be enabled to sink the player to the bottom of the seafloor. (Required to re-enter underwater vehicles)\"</i></big></p></blockquote>\n<p>The <b>Refined Scooba Tank</b> is an air tank that can be purchased from the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Shop</a> for 150 Credits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Refined Scooba Tank quadruples the user's oxygen capacity while it is equipped. It also has the added benefit that, when activated, it causes the user to sink in the water, allowing them to walk around and enter vehicles. The Refined Scooba Tank also allows for vehicles to continue to be operated while underwater, unlike the Rusty Scooba Tank. \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901162519\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 75/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 612/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019497/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.453      1 -total\n 90.46%   26.643      1 Template:Objects\n  9.40%    2.770      1 Template:Stub\n  3.87%    1.141      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2275-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901162519 and revision id 13996. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Stubs","Scooba_Tanks"],"links":[{"title":"Category:Stubs","exists":true},{"title":"River Shop","exists":true}],"images":["Refined_Scooba_Tank_object.png","Refined_Scooba_Tank.png"]}
